    "interpretation": "Target mapping-writer DATA sequence headers were visible at the loopback capture point during the exact successful-take gap. The EGO reader wait/history probes stayed not-ready with unread_count=0 until the gap's final ready/read transition, when history contained 25 samples. This supports a sample-delivery or history-insertion delay after the loopback observation point, but the capture does not prove delivery to the EGO UDP socket. The equal count of 46 RMW publishes and 46 unique gap sequence values is not a per-sample sequence-to-publish correlation.",
